{"seq":2,"slug":"verifiable-fair-random-draw","title":"可验证公平随机抽签","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/raffle-entry-drawing/verifiable-fair-random-draw","wordCount":2578,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"可验证公平随机抽签\">可验证公平随机抽签</h1><p>一个抽签系统如果只由运营方生成随机数并公布名单，那么&quot;公平&quot;这个词无法被任何外部人检验。这不是技术上的吹毛求疵——只要结果完全由一方掌握，它就具备在公布前反复重算并挑选一个&quot;理想&quot;结果的能力，而这种能力不需要被使用，只要存在就会摧毁信任。这一篇讲的是如何把随机抽签变成一个<strong>可被第三方独立复算</strong>的过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可验证抽签的目标是让<strong>第三方能够独立复算结果</strong>，而不只是让运营方声明自己公平。达成这个目标需要三样东西：一个运营方无法事后左右的随机种子、一个与遍历顺序无关的确定性映射、以及一份可以让用户自证&quot;我在被抽签的池子里&quot;的密码学承诺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"威胁模型-随机抽签要防住的三种操纵\">威胁模型：随机抽签要防住的三种操纵</h2><h3 id=\"事后挑选-内定参数-事后篡改\">事后挑选、内定参数、事后篡改</h3><p>先明确对手能做什么，才能判断一种构造是否够用。</p>\n<p><strong>第一种：事后挑选（re-roll）</strong>。运营方在抽签程序里偷偷跑一百次，选出黄牛客户最少、营销效果好、内部人最大化的那次公布。这种攻击不需要伪造任何东西——它只是没有公开&quot;我跑了多少次&quot;。防住它的唯一办法是让随机种子在<strong>看到结果之前</strong>就被固定下来。</p>\n<p><strong>第二种：内定参数</strong>。抽签由一个可调参数（种子、盐、映射顺序）驱动，而运营方在报名截止后仍然可以调整这个参数以影响结果。防住它需要种子来自一个运营方无法在事后修改的来源，或者至少让种子的选择被提前承诺。</p>\n<p><strong>第三种：事后篡改名单</strong>。抽签算法本身公平，但公布的名单与程序输出的名单不一致，或者报名池在抽签后被悄悄增删。防住它需要名单的完整性可被验证——这是哈希承诺与 Merkle 证明要解决的问题。</p>\n<p>一个重要的边界：这三种攻击都在<strong>运营方作恶</strong>的假设下。如果假设是可信任的单一运营方，那么用任何 CSPRNG 抽签就够了。可验证抽签的全部工程复杂度，都来自我们不愿意做这个假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类构造及其信任假设\">三类构造及其信任假设</h2><p>工程上可以落地的方案有三类，它们不是替代关系，而是防住不同攻击、承担不同信任假设的选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构造</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>防住的攻击</th>\n<th>信任假设</th>\n<th>验证成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承诺-揭示</td>\n<td>先发布种子的哈希承诺，截止后再揭示</td>\n<td>事后挑选、内定参数</td>\n<td>无（纯哈希）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部信标</td>\n<td>抽签种子取自公共随机信标脉冲</td>\n<td>事后挑选、内定参数</td>\n<td>信标不可预测且事后不可改</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可验证随机函数</td>\n<td>用 VRF 输出种子并附密码学证明</td>\n<td>三种全防</td>\n<td>VRF 私钥与曲线参数可信</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"承诺-揭示-最简但也最弱的约束\">承诺-揭示：最简但也最弱的约束</h3><p><strong>承诺-揭示</strong>是最简单的一类。它的构造只有一个哈希函数：运营方在窗口开启时随机取一个种子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 并公开 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = H(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，截止后公开 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 本身，任何人验证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(s) = C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 即可。这保证了运营方在报名期间无法挑种子，但无法阻止它在<strong>窗口开启前</strong>就反复试验，找到一个让它满意的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 对它自己也是先选后公开的）。要关掉这个漏洞，需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 与不可预测的外部数据绑定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"外部信标-把选种子的能力交给公共时钟\">外部信标：把选种子的能力交给公共时钟</h3><p><strong>外部信标</strong>正是为此设计的。<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/interoperable-randomness-beacons\">NIST 的可互操作随机信标项目</a>提供了一个公共服务，按固定间隔发布脉冲，每个脉冲包含时间戳、本地随机值、<strong>预承诺值</strong>（对该本地随机值的提前承诺）、输出值和签名；脉冲之间通过哈希链串联，任何企图回填历史脉冲的行为都会破坏链条。把信标脉冲的输出值作为抽签种子，运营方就失去了选取种子的能力——它只能使用一个已经发生、且被提前承诺过的值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ecvrf-让种子的唯一性可被证明\">ECVRF：让种子的唯一性可被证明</h3><p><strong>可验证随机函数（VRF）</strong> 更进一步：它不仅让种子不可预测，还让<strong>任何人都能验证这个种子确实是由该私钥对该输入计算出来的</strong>。<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc9381/\">RFC 9381</a> 定义了基于椭圆曲线的 ECVRF。它的证明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 包含三部分——曲线点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma = x H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>、截断后的挑战值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、以及标量响应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>——并按如下步骤生成与验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"ECVRF_prove(SK, alpha) -&gt; pi:&#10;  1. x, Y = derive(SK)                  # Y = x*B 为公钥&#10;  2. H = ECVRF_encode_to_curve(alpha)   # 输入映射到曲线点&#10;  3. Gamma = x * H&#10;  4. k = ECVRF_nonce_generation(SK, H)  # 确定性 nonce，见 RFC 6979 思路&#10;  5. c = ECVRF_challenge_generation(Y, H, Gamma, k*B, k*H)&#10;  6. s = (k + c*x) mod q&#10;  7. pi = point_to_string(Gamma) || int_to_string(c) || int_to_string(s)&#10;  8. beta = ECVRF_proof_to_hash(pi)     # 这就是抽签种子&#10;&#10;ECVRF_verify(PK, alpha, pi) -&gt; beta | INVALID:&#10;  1. Y = decode(PK);  校验关键参数&#10;  2. (Gamma, c, s) = decode(pi);  拒绝 malformed 或 s &gt;= q&#10;  3. H = ECVRF_encode_to_curve(alpha)&#10;  4. U = s*B - c*Y;  V = s*H - c*Gamma&#10;  5. c&#39; = ECVRF_challenge_generation(Y, H, Gamma, U, V)&#10;  6. 若 c == c&#39; 则有效，返回 beta；否则 INVALID\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ECVRF_prove(SK, alpha) -> pi:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. x, Y = derive(SK)                  # Y = x*B 为公钥</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. H = ECVRF_encode_to_curve(alpha)   # 输入映射到曲线点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. Gamma = x * H</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. k = ECVRF_nonce_generation(SK, H)  # 确定性 nonce，见 RFC 6979 思路</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. c = ECVRF_challenge_generation(Y, H, Gamma, k*B, k*H)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  6. s = (k + c*x) mod q</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  7. pi = point_to_string(Gamma) || int_to_string(c) || int_to_string(s)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  8. beta = ECVRF_proof_to_hash(pi)     # 这就是抽签种子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ECVRF_verify(PK, alpha, pi) -> beta | INVALID:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. Y = decode(PK);  校验关键参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. (Gamma, c, s) = decode(pi);  拒绝 malformed 或 s >= q</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. H = ECVRF_encode_to_curve(alpha)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. U = s*B - c*Y;  V = s*H - c*Gamma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. c' = ECVRF_challenge_generation(Y, H, Gamma, U, V)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  6. 若 c == c' 则有效，返回 beta；否则 INVALID</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RFC 9381 §3.1 给出的安全性是 <strong>full uniqueness</strong>：对固定的公钥和输入，攻击者无法构造出两个输出不同的有效证明。这正是抽签需要的性质——某个报名者在某场抽签中对应的种子是唯一确定的，运营方无法对同一个人&quot;换一个种子&quot;。</p>\n<p>如果选择链上方案，<a href=\"https://docs.chain.link/vrf/v2-5/subscription/get-a-random-number\">Chainlink VRF</a> 的订阅模式提供了托管式的等价能力。其消费者合约继承 <code>VRFConsumerBaseV2Plus</code>，调用 <code>requestRandomWords</code> 发起请求，参数包括 <code>keyHash</code>（选择链上任务）、<code>subscriptionId</code>（支付账户）、<code>requestConfirmations</code>（等待的确认数，越大越安全）、<code>callbackGasLimit</code>（回调可用 gas）、<code>numWords</code>（返回的随机词数量）；协调器随后回调 <code>fulfillRandomWords(uint256 requestId, uint256[] calldata randomWords)</code>。文档明确指出，证明是<strong>在链上验证通过之后</strong>结果才可被使用的。需要留意的是，消费者合约本身并不做密码学验证——验证由协调器完成，合约只做 <code>requestId</code> 的存在性检查。因此这条路径引入的是&quot;信任协调器与该链&quot;的假设，与自建 ECVRF 的信任模型不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从随机种子到中签名单\">从随机种子到中签名单</h2><p>拿到种子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 之后，如何把它分配到 N 个报名者上，本身就是设计的一部分，且必须<strong>完全确定、与顺序无关、且可复算</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"票号必须与遍历顺序解耦\">票号必须与遍历顺序解耦</h3><p>最容易被写错的是&quot;排序后取前 K 名&quot;。如果按报名顺序排序再按种子打乱，结果依赖排序的稳定性；如果按数据库返回顺序取，则依赖查询计划。正确的做法是构造一个<strong>与任何顺序无关</strong>的确定性映射：对每个报名者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ticket</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>entry_id</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ticket}_i = H(\\beta \\| \\text{entry\\_id}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ticket</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1097em;vertical-align:-0.3597em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">entry_id</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3597em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，然后按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ticket</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ticket}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ticket</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的字典序取前 K 名。这个构造的性质是：结果只依赖种子和报名者集合本身，与遍历顺序、分片方式、并发度都无关，因此第三方用任何语言重写都能得到完全相同的名单。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多奖项分配不能重复抽签\">多奖项分配不能重复抽签</h3><p>在多奖项场景下（比如 100 双鞋分 10 个尺码，每码 10 双），不要用同一次抽签反复抽取——那会引入&quot;同一个人中多个奖&quot;的问题。正确做法是给每个人计算一个基础票号，再按&quot;奖项 → 尺码偏好 → 票号序&quot;的依次分配，并在分配时跳过已中签者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[窗口关闭&lt;br/&gt;冻结报名池快照] --&gt; B[发布报名池摘要 H_pool]&#10;  B --&gt; C{种子来源}&#10;  C --&gt;|承诺-揭示| D[揭示 s&lt;br/&gt;验证 H s = C]&#10;  C --&gt;|外部信标| E[取脉冲输出值&lt;br/&gt;验证签名与哈希链]&#10;  C --&gt;|VRF| F[取 beta&lt;br/&gt;验证 pi 有效]&#10;  D --&gt; G[确定性票号&lt;br/&gt;ticket = H beta-entry_id]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[按 ticket 字典序取前 K]&#10;  H --&gt; I[生成中签名单&lt;br/&gt;附 inclusion proof]&#10;  I --&gt; J[公布 种子 + 名单 + 可复算脚本]\">graph TD\n  A[窗口关闭&lt;br/&gt;冻结报名池快照] --&gt; B[发布报名池摘要 H_pool]\n  B --&gt; C{种子来源}\n  C --&gt;|承诺-揭示| D[揭示 s&lt;br/&gt;验证 H s = C]\n  C --&gt;|外部信标| E[取脉冲输出值&lt;br/&gt;验证签名与哈希链]\n  C --&gt;|VRF| F[取 beta&lt;br/&gt;验证 pi 有效]\n  D --&gt; G[确定性票号&lt;br/&gt;ticket = H beta-entry_id]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[按 ticket 字典序取前 K]\n  H --&gt; I[生成中签名单&lt;br/&gt;附 inclusion proof]\n  I --&gt; J[公布 种子 + 名单 + 可复算脚本]</pre><h2 id=\"让第三方能复算-merkle-承诺与公布物\">让第三方能复算：Merkle 承诺与公布物</h2><h3 id=\"用-merkle-根承诺报名池\">用 Merkle 根承诺报名池</h3><p>即使种子和算法都公开，仍然有一个漏洞：如何证明&quot;我用来抽签的报名池，就是当初公布过的那个池子&quot;？报名池有几十万条记录，不可能把全量明文长期挂在网上给每个人下载核对（虽然摘要可以）。</p>\n<p>Merkle 树是标准答案。<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc9162/\">RFC 9162</a> 定义的 Merkle Tree Hash 采用域分隔前缀避免第二原像攻击：叶子用 <code>0x00</code>、内部节点用 <code>0x01</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MTH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>HASH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>MTH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>HASH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>00</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MTH}(\\{\\}) = \\text{HASH}() \\qquad \\text{MTH}(\\{d_0\\}) = \\text{HASH}(0x00 \\| d_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HASH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HASH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">00∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MTH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>HASH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext>MTH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext>MTH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MTH}(D_n) = \\text{HASH}(0x01 \\| \\text{MTH}(D[0{:}k]) \\| \\text{MTH}(D[k{:}n]))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HASH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">01∥</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTH</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的最大 2 的幂。在这个结构下，运营方公布的是<strong>根哈希</strong>（一个短字符串），而每个用户可以拿到一条 <strong>inclusion proof</strong>——从自己的叶子一路合并到根的兄弟节点列表。用户本地复算后如果等于公布的根，就证明了&quot;我的报名确实在被抽签的那个池子里&quot;。RFC 9162 §2.1.3.2 给出了标准验证流程：拒绝 <code>leaf_index &gt;= tree_size</code>，用索引的二进制位决定每个节点放在左还是右，逐层做 <code>HASH(0x01 || left || right)</code>，最终位置索引归零且哈希等于根才算通过。</p>\n<h3 id=\"公布物清单\">公布物清单</h3><p>同理，名单也可以只用根哈希承诺，用户校验自己的 inclusion proof 即可，无需下载全量名单。外部信标方案还可以额外做 <strong>consistency proof</strong>：RFC 9162 §2.1.4 指出&quot;Merkle 一致性证明证明树的只追加属性&quot;，因此平台可以证明&quot;本次公布的报名池是在上一场抽签的池子之上仅追加形成的&quot;，防止历史被回填。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可验证抽签要防住三种操纵：事后挑选、内定参数、事后篡改名单。三者都在&quot;运营方可能作恶&quot;的假设下才有意义。</li>\n<li>承诺-揭示最简，但无法约束窗口开启前的选种子行为；外部信标（NIST 随机信标脉冲）通过提前承诺的公开随机值关掉这个漏洞；ECVRF（RFC 9381）额外提供 full uniqueness，让任何人对任何输入的种子的唯一性都可验证。</li>\n<li>从种子到名单必须用<strong>与顺序无关的确定性映射</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ticket</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>entry_id</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ticket}_i = H(\\beta \\| \\text{entry\\_id}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ticket</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1097em;vertical-align:-0.3597em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">entry_id</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3597em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 后取字典序前 K，而不是&quot;排序后打乱&quot;。</li>\n<li>Merkle 树（RFC 9162）让运营方只需公布根哈希，用户凭 inclusion proof 即可自证&quot;我在被抽签的池子里&quot;，并用 consistency proof 证明池子只追加。</li>\n<li>公布物应当包含：报名池根哈希、种子及其来源证明、中签名单根哈希、以及可复算脚本。缺任何一项，&quot;可验证&quot;都会退化成&quot;请相信我们&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可验证公平随机抽签","id":"可验证公平随机抽签"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"威胁模型：随机抽签要防住的三种操纵","id":"威胁模型-随机抽签要防住的三种操纵"},{"level":3,"text":"事后挑选、内定参数、事后篡改","id":"事后挑选-内定参数-事后篡改"},{"level":2,"text":"三类构造及其信任假设","id":"三类构造及其信任假设"},{"level":3,"text":"承诺-揭示：最简但也最弱的约束","id":"承诺-揭示-最简但也最弱的约束"},{"level":3,"text":"外部信标：把选种子的能力交给公共时钟","id":"外部信标-把选种子的能力交给公共时钟"},{"level":3,"text":"ECVRF：让种子的唯一性可被证明","id":"ecvrf-让种子的唯一性可被证明"},{"level":2,"text":"从随机种子到中签名单","id":"从随机种子到中签名单"},{"level":3,"text":"票号必须与遍历顺序解耦","id":"票号必须与遍历顺序解耦"},{"level":3,"text":"多奖项分配不能重复抽签","id":"多奖项分配不能重复抽签"},{"level":2,"text":"让第三方能复算：Merkle 承诺与公布物","id":"让第三方能复算-merkle-承诺与公布物"},{"level":3,"text":"用 Merkle 根承诺报名池","id":"用-merkle-根承诺报名池"},{"level":3,"text":"公布物清单","id":"公布物清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"抽签报名窗口与资格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/raffle-entry-drawing/raffle-registration-window"},"next":{"title":"中签/候补/放弃处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/raffle-entry-drawing/win-waitlist-abandon"}}